## 8. Acceptance Criteria

### Home screen
- [ ] Week strip shows the current week with today in a white filled circle
- [ ] Tapping a different day circle switches the list to that day's scheduled habits
- [ ] Tapping the checkbox marks the habit complete with green check, strikethrough name, light haptic, and smooth scale animation
- [ ] Flame icon and streak number appear only when streak ≥ 1
- [ ] FAB presents the habit library sheet
- [ ] Bottom navigation switches between Home and Insights without animation glitches
- [ ] Long-press shows native context menu with all five options
- [ ] Swipe left on a row reveals Edit and Delete quick actions

### Creation sheet
- [ ] All three frequency modes render their distinct sub-controls
- [ ] Daily mode shows selected day names as comma-separated text above the weekday picker
- [ ] Stepper minus button is disabled at value 1
- [ ] Monthly stepper allows arbitrarily high values (no upper cap up to 999)
- [ ] Reminder toggle reveals time picker when on
- [ ] Create button is disabled until name is non-empty
- [ ] Emoji picker opens on tap of the emoji chip
- [ ] Editing an existing habit pre-fills all fields correctly

### Library
- [ ] Category chips scroll horizontally with the active category highlighted
- [ ] Search bar filters templates across all categories live
- [ ] Tapping a template pre-fills the creation sheet
- [ ] "Create a custom habit" CTA stays pinned at the bottom of the sheet

### Insights
- [ ] All four time range tabs (W, M, Y, All) work without locks or paywall prompts
- [ ] Heatmap renders 26 weeks of past data, even if mostly empty
- [ ] Progress chart shows one bar per day in the selected range
- [ ] Top Performing list shows all habits unblurred, ranked by completion rate
- [ ] Date range chevrons navigate to previous and next periods

### Notifications
- [ ] Enabling reminder on a habit schedules a daily local notification
- [ ] Disabling reminder cancels the scheduled notification
- [ ] Updating a habit's reminder time updates the notification trigger
- [ ] Notification authorization prompt appears on first reminder enabled

### Persistence
- [ ] All data survives app relaunch via SwiftData
- [ ] Export creates a valid JSON file accessible through the share sheet
- [ ] Reset to demo data restores the seed dataset
- [ ] Clear all data wipes everything after confirmation

### Accessibility
- [ ] All interactive elements have `accessibilityLabel`
- [ ] Dynamic Type is supported (text scales with system setting)
- [ ] VoiceOver works for all flows
- [ ] Color contrast meets WCAG AA

