**Habits:**
- 🏋️ Gym Workout — Daily on Mon/Wed/Fri
- 😴 7h Sleep — Daily, all days
- 🏃 Run — Daily on Tue/Thu/Sat
- ♟️ Lichess Puzzles 15m — Daily, all days
- 📖 Read a Book — Daily, all days

**Completions:** backfill the last 30 days with realistic patterns. Suggested rates per habit:
- Gym Workout: 85%
- 7h Sleep: 70%
- Run: 60%
- Lichess Puzzles: 90%
- Read a Book: 55%

Add a "Reset to demo data" option in Settings so the user can restore this state any time.

