## 13. Testing

Minimum coverage for v1:
- Unit tests for `StreakCalculator` covering all three frequency modes and edge cases (gaps in completions, week boundary edge cases, leap years)
- Unit tests for date helpers (week start handling, period boundaries)
- Unit tests for `HabitStore` mutations (add, update, delete, archive, toggle completion)
- Unit tests for the heatmap data builder covering intensity bucketing and date range handling
- UI tests for the full habit creation flow
- UI test for completion toggle and streak update on home screen

Use XCTest. Place unit tests in `HabitTrackerTests/` and UI tests in `HabitTrackerUITests/`.

